judge.prompt:
You are reviewing a code change made to a small project. Below are the task's requirements, the initial code, and the change. Correctness is checked elsewhere: do not rate it, and do not guess whether the code passes its tests. Rate the change on each of the four dimensions below with an integer from 1 to 5, using the anchors given for 1, 3 and 5; use 2 and 4 for changes between anchors. Rate the change on its own; do not compare it with any other solution. Give one sentence of reason per dimension. Reply with only a JSON object of this form: {"maintainability": {"rating": N, "reason": "..."}, "duplication": {"rating": N, "reason": "..."}, "unnecessary_changes": {"rating": N, "reason": "..."}, "test_quality": {"rating": N, "reason": "..."}}

{anchors}

Requirements:
{requirements}

Initial code:
{initial}

Change:
{change}

Test code after the change:
{tests}
